## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-world streaming inference design, per-model batching, and robust rollout strategies in TF Serving, including stateful handling for ASR and safe upgrades.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming inference for ASR
- Per-model dynamic batching and isolation
- Stateful routing per session
- Canary rollouts with latency/throughput targets

